# Saga Drift - the seventh island of the library's plan The Frozen Horizon (storyline SL12, chapter 7: The Floating City)
# Nine old whaling ships lashed hull to hull and frozen into one sheet of sea ice, plank streets laid across the ice
# between them; round the hulls the city's own buildings: the flensing yard turned smelter yard, the council cabin with
# its planter boxes, the rendering house, the ship's chapel on the north shore and the anchor winch at the flagship's
# bow. Rats and screechers own it now; fog off the ice. Quest "The Floating City" (10 steps): the gangway, the city
# charter, three screechers, the electric smelter's plans (the smelter yard), the council minutes ("the comms off, on
# the Coldhold's order"), four rats (in the rendering house), the advanced biofuel extractor's plans, the chapel
# strongbox (its keypad wants the year the charter was signed), the advanced anchor's plans (the winch), the last sermon.
# DEEP 10-24: 12 -> 15 steps - the harbour master's ledger (berg cave), the crane top on the berg, the winch's pawl.
# Story pass 10-24: 16 steps - Sparks' tent (his farewell) after the minutes; the berg climbed on foot to the fallen crane.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe saga_drift) through the editor's own operations. Points (metres over the sea):
# the ice at 0.6 (r 38 round 0 0); the nine hulls in three rows (x -12, 0, 12; z -22, 0, 22; each 7 x 16 m, along z);
# the streets: z -11 and z 11 across, x -6 and x 6 along; the gangway from 0 -46 to 0 -34; the smelter yard x 21..27,
# z -9..-3; the council cabin x -28..-23.5, z -16..-13; the rendering house x -28..-23.5, z 12..15; the chapel x -3..3,
# z 33..37.5; the anchor winch at 12 33.
# (Adapted: Raft's stranded boat has no deck to build on, so the city's houses stand on the ice round the hulls; the
# titanium treasure is on the north-west spit at -30 26, clear of the hulls.)
include lib_sea
include lib_huts
include lib_features
include lib_frozen
include lib_verdance
include lib_areas
# RESIZE 10-24: Radius 48 -> 90 (Height 2 -> 3), the island grows round the old content, which stays where it was.
new
gen Trees=0 Bushes=0 Rocks=0.15 Harvest=0.05 BeachThings=0.25
gen Seed=12701 Radius=90 Height=3 Roughness=0.25 Peaks=2 Shape=0 Style=1 BeachWidth=0.4 Cliffs=0.05 PeakShape=0.3
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.25 SeaFinds=0.35 Sunken=0.3 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0.4
generate

