# --- DEEP 10-24 (one-hour pass): the Berg Quarter, the net loft, the tenth ship ---------------------------------------
# The Berg Quarter (east): an iceberg frozen into the city's ice, 24 m, climbed on foot; on its top the old harbour
# crane's fallen cab (story pass 10-24: a cairn, the winch's pawl in the crane cab chest; no tower, no zipline); the berg cave on its south
# side (the harbour master's ledger); the net loft ruin and the West Ridge; the tenth ship, sunk 14 m in the south-west
# (its strongbox, an air pocket); a third buried treasure on the berg's foot.
call fz_mount x=64 z=-4 h=24 r=7
call ar_plants_snowy x=64 z=-4 r=26 seed=12745
call fz_cairn x=64 z=-1 al=cranecairn chest=cranecab zal=cranezone zid=crane_top msg="The berg's top. The old harbour crane lies toppled down the far side; its split cab sits here on the ice. Below, the nine ships - and from here you see the dark shape under the ice beside the city: a tenth."
place Beam_Long_01 cranejib at 60.6 -6.2 ground y=0.2 yaw=35
place Beam_Long_01 cranejib at 61.8 -7.6 ground y=0.25 yaw=80
prop cranejib tint.color=#5a3a2a
