prop chapelbox else.open=message||The strongbox is locked. The keypad beside it wants a year.

quest title=The Floating City
quest intro=Nine ships frozen into one city - and silent. Make for the forest of masts and climb the gangway.
step reach|gangway|1|Make for the nine ships; climb the gangway onto the ice
step read|City charter|1|Read the city charter by the gangway
step kill|Screecher|3|Drive off the three screechers nesting on the masts
step blueprint|Blueprint_SmelterElectric|1|Take the electric smelter's plans from the smelter yard
step read|Council cabin minutes|1|Read the council cabin minutes
step read|Sparks' farewell|1|Find the banished radio man's tent on the ice outside the ships
step open|Chapel strongbox|1|Open the chapel strongbox (the charter knows its year)
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the four rats out of the rendering house
step blueprint|Blueprint_BiofuelExtractorAdvanced|1|Take the advanced biofuel extractor's plans from the rendering house
step read|Harbour master's ledger|1|The winch's pawl is gone. Find the harbour master's ledger in the cave at the foot of the big iceberg
step reach|crane_top|1|Climb the iceberg on foot to the fallen crane's cab on its top
step collect|story:pawl|1|Take the winch's pawl from the crane cab chest
step collect|story:bellrung|3|Ring the three ships' bells - "all hands"
step collect|story:winchfree|1|Turn the anchor winch at the flagship's bow
step blueprint|Blueprint_AnchorStationaryAdvanced|1|Take the advanced anchor's plans from the winch locker
step read|Last sermon|1|Read the chaplain's last sermon
quest done=The vault ordered the silence. The glacier calls on 1000.
quest reward=MetalIngot*3;Rope*4;Raw_Beet*3

